[One] of the[ worthy] sons of the African soil, former President Thabo Mvuyel[wa] Mbeki, was the main “[mid]wife” in the delivery room of this new born baby[.] We[ owe] much[ to] this African despite some having tried[ to] down[play] is effort to the[ extent] of boasting about clipping[ is][ wings] so that he could not deliver[ on] the assignment. There[ is][ no] doubt that Mbeki is wont to live his[ African] dream[ and][ has] to be supported as[ much] as he has to be[ comm]ended for a job well done.
